## 8. Base System Configurations
### Configure Persistent Filesystem Mounts
Ensure your local storage maps identically upon reboots:
```bash
nano /etc/fstab
```
Populate it with your partition details, ensuring the unencrypted partition cleanly points directly to `/boot`:
```text
# <fs>                  <mountpoint>    <type>      <opts>                                  <dump/pass>
LABEL=GentooBoot        /boot           vfat        defaults                                0 2
LABEL=GentooRoot        /               btrfs       defaults,subvol=@                       0 1
LABEL=GentooRoot        /home           btrfs       defaults,subvol=@home                   0 0
LABEL=GentooRoot        /.snapshots     btrfs       defaults,subvol=@.snapshots             0 0




